   "body": "Also for this follow-up (left open by #1350's round 4, Low): `ThemedDestructiveTests.underAThemeADisabledLabelIsDimmed` asserts `R > G+25`, which the dimmed **system** red also passes; tighten it (for example `pixel[1] > 70`, CI pixel of the themed dimmed red was [72,55,63] before the fix) so it fails if the themed colour is lost.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
